{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/TitleBannerEN.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save the world by fishing!  A new pixel open world action RPG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the story of two young men who set out on an adventure to fish for the Sea'Az, the marine creatures of this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Fishing_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To catch Sea'Az, perform a successful \u201cGauge Action\u201d. If you stop the bar at the \u201cHit Area\u201d or \u201cCritical Area\u201d in the gauge at the right time, you can damage Sea'Az. Successful fishing is achieved by continuing to inflict damage and reducing the HP to 0! Be careful, as there are SeaAZ with more powerful individual \u201cgauge gimmick\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/FishingEN.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Craft_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create equipment (fishing rods and hooks) using materials obtained from the Sea'Az you catch. By creating strong equipment, you can take advantage of the fishing action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/CraftEN.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Change_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rod and Axel go on an adventurous journey together.<br>Let him do all the fishing for Sea'Az and stripping of materials.<br> Let Axel take care of everything, such as removing obstacles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/ChangeAll.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Boss_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes there are vicious Sea'Az that will attack you.<br>Let's work together with Axel and Rod to catch them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Boss_A.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Boss_R.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Ship_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast pixel world freely by boat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/ShipAll.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Action_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is not only about fishing.<br>You can enjoy various 2D action elements in between fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Sensikan.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Trokko.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Master of Tarte island","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/d1d436e0c3318f8d184a0574cdbbb4630ffab696.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Secret cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/0e38a5cea43ca92b84932bb5ed3446be52ce5521.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Stone shrine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/5d0cb78519e66dd53ca16bb3fff59517e8039112.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Calm sea island","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/a196d36a6537c9d65322bdd20208bdf34c45d666.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Sahaland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/64d39131bb6ca48dac150d77bea7124dc568f318.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/cbf3410c420b11e7ae5d808988700429f3ca993d.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Rimul Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/1ffe07889fa067bb3a5b1ea02946ee1c833ce20a.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Great Snow Sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/eb195268660a917b61bb6ef2301468d30818669b.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Volcanic Crater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/df944a51094465dd78dd6b2091986db1059f66d2.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Sea(Morning)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2835110/5f5957c09117b7828c35d48c03286aa5d52142f0.jpg"}],"total":38},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2835110?t=1739081453","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739081453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/c61766ed2b8a267b77c3fa76f4985658f3a90d12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739081453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/c61766ed2b8a267b77c3fa76f4985658f3a90d12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739081453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/TitleBannerEN.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save the world by fishing!  A new pixel open world action RPG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the story of two young men who set out on an adventure to fish for the Sea'Az, the marine creatures of this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Fishing_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To catch Sea'Az, perform a successful \u201cGauge Action\u201d. If you stop the bar at the \u201cHit Area\u201d or \u201cCritical Area\u201d in the gauge at the right time, you can damage Sea'Az. Successful fishing is achieved by continuing to inflict damage and reducing the HP to 0! Be careful, as there are SeaAZ with more powerful individual \u201cgauge gimmick\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/FishingEN.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Craft_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create equipment (fishing rods and hooks) using materials obtained from the Sea'Az you catch. By creating strong equipment, you can take advantage of the fishing action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/CraftEN.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Change_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rod and Axel go on an adventurous journey together.<br>Let him do all the fishing for Sea'Az and stripping of materials.<br> Let Axel take care of everything, such as removing obstacles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/ChangeAll.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Boss_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes there are vicious Sea'Az that will attack you.<br>Let's work together with Axel and Rod to catch them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Boss_A.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Boss_R.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Ship_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast pixel world freely by boat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/ShipAll.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Action_EN.png?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is not only about fishing.<br>You can enjoy various 2D action elements in between fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Sensikan.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/extras/Trokko.gif?t=1739081453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["METASLA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835110/header.jpg?t=1739081453","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257082964,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082964/movie480.mp4?t=1734484398","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082964/movie_max.mp4?t=1734484398"},"name":"PV4_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257082964/38dabd259137bc88b1397eaf5c86310e87f79a0d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1734484398","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082964/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1734484398","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082964/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1734484398"}}],"name":"Sea Fantasy","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Sea Fantasy - $14.99 USD","packageid":1011805,"percent_sav